      "At least one of the following holds, and possibly more than one: (a) The thrower who complains of a turned ankle and Morag Inglis are exactly one throw step apart in best throw order, in one direction or the other. (b) Lachlan Cree is shorter than the thrower who complains of no excuse whatsoever in best throw order.",
      "The thrower who complains of a turned ankle and Isla Kinnear are exactly one throw step apart in best throw order, in one direction or the other.",
      "The thrower who complains of a slipped grip is shorter than the thrower who competes in the open stone in best throw order.",
